About the job
Skills Were Looking For:        Strong communication, networking, and relationship-building skills.        Confident public speaker with event management expertise.        Target-oriented, proactive, and self-driven team player.Roles and Responsibilities: Act as the official representative and Brand Ambassador of Study Smart at your college. Promote our services through various channels within your college and other institutions. Organize and conduct awareness campaigns, workshops, and presentations. Utilize your networking skills to reach out to potential students interested in studying abroad or preparing for IELTS. Leverage digital marketing tools, social media, blogs, and student portals to enhance our visibility. Facilitate student visits to our offices and maintain a database for marketing purposes. Manage promotional materials such as posters, banners, and standees on campus. Provide counseling to prospective students, dispelling myths about studying abroad. Arrange seminars and workshops to educate students about opportunities abroad.Your Rewards: Rs. 5,000 per student successfully enrolled in any foreign university. Rs. 500 per student successfully enrolled for IELTS/PTE/TOEFL training. Rs. 300 per student for every walk-in or counselling session arranged. Rs. 2000- Rs.5000 stipend per month. Certificate of Experience from Study Smart. Recommendation on LinkedIn.

